BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (  # The Myth of the Three Springs) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (  In ancient times, there were two villages separated by a mystical canyon. Each moon, the River) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (     Village received five silver coins from the mountain. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (  A brave messenger could carry coins across the bridge to the Desert Village, where the Springs) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (     of Abundance tripled whatever touched their waters. But the Desert Village's elder alone de) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (    cided what to return.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (  The first messenger, fearful, kept all five coins. Both villages stayed poor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (  The second messenger sent everything. The springs multiplied the coins to fifteen, but a greed) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (    y elder returned nothing. The messenger's village starved.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (  Then came wise Maya. She sent three coins, showing trust but keeping her village safe. The spr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (    ings transformed them to nine. The Desert elder, touched by this balanced faith, returned fi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (    ve coins. Maya's village gained two; the Desert kept four. Both prospered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (  But sometimes, the canyon winds twisted their messages. Maya might send three, but the elder h) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (    eard "two." The elder might return five, but Maya received "four." ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (  The villages learned: true partnership means trusting despite the winds, returning generously ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (    when blessed, and forgiving the canyon's distortions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (  Thus cooperation, not fear or greed, made both villages flourish across the seasons.) Tj ET
