BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (      In ancient times, there were two villages separated by a mystical canyon. Each moon, the R) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (        iver Village received five silver coins from the mountain. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      A brave messenger could carry coins across the bridge to the Desert Village, where the Spr) Tj ET
