BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (        alone decided what to return.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      The first messenger, fearful, kept all five coins. Both villages stayed poor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
