BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (    # The Myth of the Three Springs) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (    In ancient times, there were two villages separated by a mystical canyon. Each moon, the Riv) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (      er Village received five silver coins from the mountain. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (    A brave messenger could carry coins across the bridge to the Desert Village, where the Sprin) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      gs of Abundance tripled whatever touched their waters. But the Desert Village's elder alon) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      e decided what to return.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (    The first messenger, fearful, kept all five coins. Both villages stayed poor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (    The second messenger sent everything. The springs multiplied the coins to fifteen, but a gre) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (      edy elder returned nothing. The messenger's village starved.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (    Then came wise Maya. She sent three coins, showing trust but keeping her village safe. The s) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      prings transformed them to nine. The Desert elder, touched by this balanced faith, returne) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (      d five coins. Maya's village gained two; the Desert kept four. Both prospered.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (    But sometimes, the canyon winds twisted their messages. Maya might send three, but the elder) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (       heard "two." The elder might return five, but Maya received "four." ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    The villages learned: true partnership means trusting despite the winds, returning generousl) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      y when blessed, and forgiving the canyon's distortions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (    Thus cooperation, not fear or greed, made both villages flourish across the seasons.) Tj ET
